      "mergedPostDetails": "**Steps to reproduce:**\n\n1. Open VRChat in desktop mode.\n\n2. Enter a world with custom keybinds, such as 'T' or 'G' for third person view. I will use **SuRroom** as an example.\n\n3. Open the chatbox using 'Y'.\n\n4. Press the letter 'G' while the chatbox is open.\n\n**Actual result:**\n\nThe third person keybind the world has set up continues to function upon pressing 'G' despite the player intending to type into the chatbox.\n\n**Expected result:**\n\nThe world ignores keystroke inputs while the chatbox is open, just like the built in VRChat keybinds.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Worlds continue receiving keystrokes despite chatbox being open in desktop mode",
